# Symbol-prefixed BoringSSL oracle (libssl.a + libcrypto.a + vendored headers), provisioned by the
# buildBoringsslOracle<Arch> Gradle task (or copied from a sibling prebuilt tree on a dev box). Never
# commit the .a binaries or vendored headers — same policy as buffer-crypto/.gitignore. Rebuilt in CI
# from the pinned commit.
/libs/boringssl-oracle/
# Legacy path (pre-decoupling, libssl-only). Kept ignored so a stale tree never gets committed.
/libs/boringssl-ssl/
